---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {videos} from '../../data/demo';
export function getStaticPaths(){return videos.map(v=>({params:{slug:v.slug},props:{video:v}}));}
const {video:v}=Astro.props;
---
<Layout title={v.title}><div class="wrap detail"><a class="breadcrumb" href="/library/videos/">← 返回比赛视频</a><div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">{v.event || '赛事待考证'}</p><h1>{v.title}</h1><p>录像详情示例。赛事信息、参赛方与拍摄日期均未提供。</p></div><div class="player-placeholder"><span class="play-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▷</span><h2>暂未接入媒体</h2><p>这里是播放器区域示意，没有真实比赛录像。</p></div><div class="detail-actions"><button class="pill" data-demo="下载原视频">下载原视频（模拟） ↓</button><p>本阶段仅验证页面与反馈；播放和进度拖动留待媒体阶段。</p></div></div></Layout>
